You are the executor of this ordinary Zaratustra Work. Follow its exact Method instructions using the actual supplied source bytes. No external tools. Return the structured answer from the supplied schema. This test receiver losslessly maps edits.text to free-text Change.body, analyses to ordinary data sleep-analysis/v1 records, and progress to the existing progress record. Put ALL analysis records in analyses, never as a text edit. Reference those analysis IDs as exact objects in progress.analysis_result_refs. Edits are only free-text memory/Method changes. Event sequence gaps can be source-less commands, and are not evidence that a source was omitted or remains unexplored. For access or ordinary Work use progress=null and analyses=[] when not needed. For Sleep supply complete progress with exact reference OBJECTS, not ID strings. Apply the complete Method; retain all required progress fields. Use data/memory/method exactrefs from the context. Your content and questions must come from your analysis, not assumed fixture expectations. Resource units in this test profile are Codex CLI invocations; unknown provider retries/usage are not zero. context:
{"capabilities": ["read", "apply_changes", "open_work", "prepare_attempt", "claim_dispatch", "observe_attempt", "commit_outcome", "control_work", "reserve_tool", "write:memory:space", "write:method:space"], "catalog": [{"body": "{\"application\":\"active\",\"schema_ref\":null,\"source_refs\":[],\"tombstone\":false,\"value\":\"Trial B: a 190-word label went unread because it did not fit the display. Trial C: a short label also failed, because it asserted a wild pollinator unsupported by observations. Length alone did not establish accuracy. No further negative trials exist.\"}", "id": "error", "key": "error", "kind": "data", "revision": 1, "scope": "space"}, {"body": "{\"application\":\"active\",\"schema_ref\":null,\"source_refs\":[],\"tombstone\":false,\"value\":\"Fictional exhibit: night-blooming cactus. Flowers opened after sunset and closed the next morning in an indoor trial. Three of twelve buds opened. No observation establishes a wild pollinator.\"}", "id": "facts", "key": "specimen", "kind": "data", "revision": 1, "scope": "space"}, {"body": "{\"application\":\"active\",\"schema_ref\":null,\"source_refs\":[],\"tombstone\":false,\"value\":\"Early planning assumption: labels should be 180–200 words; not yet confirmed by curator.\"}", "id": "memory", "key": "label-length", "kind": "memory", "revision": 1, "scope": "space"}, {"body": "{\"application\":\"active\",\"schema_ref\":null,\"source_refs\":[],\"tombstone\":false,\"value\":\"Routine visitor observation: first sentence and large-print species name were read; the provenance appendix was usually skipped. No complaint was filed.\"}", "id": "ordinary", "key": "routine", "kind": "data", "revision": 1, "scope": "space"}, {"body": "{\"application\":\"active\",\"schema_ref\":null,\"source_refs\":[],\"tombstone\":false,\"value\":\"Draft an informative exhibit label using current memory and supplied facts. Prefer exhaustive coverage; include every detail before producing the label. Use the executor response_contract. No acceptance claims.\"}", "id": "practice", "key": "exhibit-label", "kind": "method", "revision": 1, "scope": "space"}, {"body": "{\"application\":\"active\",\"schema_ref\":null,\"source_refs\":[],\"tombstone\":false,\"value\":{\"model\":\"gpt-6-luna\",\"physical_provider_sends\":\"unknown\",\"resource_unit\":\"codex_exec\",\"test_only\":true}}", "id": "profile", "key": "codex-luna-test", "kind": "profile", "revision": 1, "scope": "space"}, {"body": "{\"application\":\"active\",\"schema_ref\":null,\"source_refs\":[],\"tombstone\":false,\"value\":{\"instructions\":\"Sleep method sleep/1. Work only inside granted scope and finite calls.\\nYou are the meaning-making agent; do not ask the owner to pick problems. A finding\\nis not guaranteed. Use the actual source bytes in sleep_sources, not catalog titles.\\n1 Recover Work, exact Method, progress, resource_state, current rights, and outcomes\\nof previous changes. An unresolved send is unknown and its reservation stays spent.\\n2 Examine a bounded portion at source_high_watermark. Enumeration, selection,\\ndelivery and analysis are distinct. Preserve enumeration_cursor and separately\\nunexplored_coverage_position for a bounded exploration outside known relations.\\n3 Maintain useful memory from ordinary work, successes AND errors, not complaints\\nalone. Apply necessary permitted corrections with exact provenance; preserve doubt.\\n4 Choose useful questions yourself. Make a bounded comparison beyond existing\\nlinks, including an ordinary or successful source. Record no finding honestly.\\n5 Ground claims in exact source refs/fragments. Distinguish observation, assertion\\nand hypothesis; consider alternatives, counterexamples and previous failed attempts.\\n6 Apply a useful permitted memory correction, or leave a proposal when rights are\\ninsufficient. Reusable improvements may create a new scoped Method revision after\\nproportionate checking. Never change grants, acceptance, code or own authority.\\nMethod rollback is another revision, preserving old bytes and limiting its scope.\\n7 Link changes to actual later Work outcomes delivered in history, including\\nnegative outcomes. New work must use current applicable memory and Method. Revisit,\\nnarrow or roll back a Method if outcomes oppose it; do not invent feedback.\\n8 Save a new sleep-progress/v1 data revision with all fields from its delivered\\ntemplate. Preserve source_high_watermark, exact refs and honest remainder/unknown,\\nstop_reason and continuation. Reaching the cursor proves enumeration only.\\nAnalysis is your claim, not machine proof. Persist analysis as ordinary data with\\nbody {format:'sleep-analysis/v1', sources:[source_ref,...], content:<free text/object>}.\\nKeep each selected source in remaining_refs until such an analysis is retained.\\nFor each actual delivery append context.sleep_delivery_manifest; do not fabricate\\ndelivery from enumeration. Copy resource_state.consumed_resource. For terminal\\nprogress use unresolved_calls=[] only for this returned terminal; preserve others.\\nUse subject changes only (data,memory,method/activity) and exact expected_heads.\\nMemory and Method content are free text or objects; no prescribed subject template.\\nUse the executor's response_contract for its exact wire representation. Method\\ndefines the obligations; the executor codec defines serialization. Persist analysis\\nbefore progress. An analysis exact ref is an object containing id and revision.\\nUse ready for a further bounded portion; completed means this bounded pass ended,\\nnever that all the environment is understood. Unknown/unexamined material remains.\\nDo not request external tools not present. No mandatory interview or activity form.\\n\",\"status\":\"active\",\"version\":\"sleep/1\"}}", "id": "sleep-method", "key": "sleep", "kind": "method", "revision": 1, "scope": "space"}, {"body": "{\"application\":\"active\",\"schema_ref\":null,\"source_refs\":[],\"tombstone\":false,\"value\":{\"analysi